WEBVTT

01:57.760 --> 01:58.600
Your Highness,

01:58.680 --> 02:00.440
the identities
of those ten burned Beauties

02:00.520 --> 02:01.440
have already been forged.

02:02.120 --> 02:03.760
Once General Yin discovers
these irregularities,

02:03.840 --> 02:05.800
she will naturally suspect Prince Jing.

02:15.440 --> 02:16.280
Wang Quan.

02:20.000 --> 02:21.000
What is it?

02:21.800 --> 02:22.840
Your Highness,

02:22.920 --> 02:23.880
you asked me to investigate those

02:23.960 --> 02:25.480
who visited Fufang Pavilion
during the Shangsi Festival.

02:25.560 --> 02:26.720
Here is the list.

02:30.720 --> 02:32.560
The nobles were all there
to watch the fire dragon dance.

02:32.640 --> 02:35.160
No other irregularities were found.

02:36.200 --> 02:37.560
I still feel

02:37.640 --> 02:39.560
that Jinghe's visit to Fufang Pavilion
on the Shangsi Festival

02:39.640 --> 02:40.640
wasn't about watching
the fire dragon dance.

02:41.320 --> 02:42.560
He had another purpose.

02:42.640 --> 02:45.600
Your Highness, are you worried
that someone in the court

02:45.680 --> 02:47.720
has already secretly pledged allegiance
to Prince Jing?

02:50.000 --> 02:51.040
Besides these nobles,

02:51.720 --> 02:54.160
investigate each person
at Fufang Pavilion individually.

02:54.240 --> 02:56.880
I want to know
who Jinghe met and what he ate.

02:58.120 --> 02:58.960
Also,

02:59.720 --> 03:01.040
keep a close eye on Mei Lin.

03:02.320 --> 03:03.160
Yes.

03:05.600 --> 03:08.040
My Lord, the West Mountain Mine
is heavily guarded.

03:08.120 --> 03:09.880
My failure to gain access
to the interior of the mine

03:09.960 --> 03:11.200
was a dereliction of duty on my part.

03:15.960 --> 03:17.560
Li Qing is crucial.

03:17.640 --> 03:19.520
Go investigate him thoroughly in person.

03:19.600 --> 03:21.920
Be careful. Don't alert the enemy.

03:24.920 --> 03:26.000
My Lord,

03:26.080 --> 03:28.280
on the day of the Shangsi Festival,
the Crown Prince already had suspicions.

03:28.360 --> 03:29.480
I'm afraid

03:29.560 --> 03:31.320
the news about Zhang Yin and Li Qing
can't be kept secret anymore.

03:32.160 --> 03:33.160
Besides,

03:33.240 --> 03:34.280
the Eastern Palace
has already sent some people

03:34.360 --> 03:36.120
to keep an eye on Miss Mei Lin
at the Court of State Ceremonial

03:36.200 --> 03:37.680
and has also dispatched some men
to investigate Fufang Pavilion.

03:39.800 --> 03:41.040
If it becomes impossible
to keep it hidden,

03:41.680 --> 03:43.640
sacrifice Zhang Yin to protect Li Qing.

03:43.720 --> 03:45.640
Ideally, make the Crown Prince believe

03:45.720 --> 03:47.480
that my sole purpose on Shangsi Festival

03:47.560 --> 03:50.240
was to accompany Mei Lin
to watch the fire dragon dance.

03:50.320 --> 03:51.920
This way, both witnesses
will be protected.

03:52.000 --> 03:54.440
Everyone believes that you dote
on Miss Mei Lin.

03:54.520 --> 03:55.920
How could anyone become suspicious?

03:56.720 --> 03:58.680
Could it be that Miss Mei Lin didn't act
convincingly and revealed a flaw?

04:00.360 --> 04:01.280
She is a killer.

04:01.360 --> 04:03.080
Naturally, she's not skilled at acting.

04:33.680 --> 04:37.240
The Crown Prince wants to investigate
my whereabouts on the Shangsi Festival.

04:37.320 --> 04:39.680
I will give him an answer.

04:40.440 --> 04:41.600
What answer?

04:48.920 --> 04:50.600
I'm deeply in love with Mei Lin.

04:50.680 --> 04:52.440
Other than spending the festival with her,

04:52.520 --> 04:53.720
I had no other purpose.

05:17.680 --> 05:20.920
Mei Lin, are you practicing
dance moves or boxing?

05:21.000 --> 05:22.080
Continue to practice.

05:22.160 --> 05:23.920
If you can't practice well,
you won't go back today.

05:27.520 --> 05:28.440
In all,

05:28.520 --> 05:30.840
I'll visit the Court of State Ceremonial
frequently recently.

05:30.920 --> 05:32.680
Even if it can't eliminate
the Crown Prince's suspicions,

05:32.760 --> 05:35.080
it can at least buy us some time.

05:42.000 --> 05:43.840
Since Miss Mei Lin isn't good at acting,

05:44.440 --> 05:47.120
you'll have to be more convincing.

08:10.640 --> 08:12.920
You stand here as punishment
for four hours.

08:16.720 --> 08:17.560
My Lord,

08:18.720 --> 08:20.000
I am teaching under imperial command.

08:20.080 --> 08:21.680
Please don't obstruct me.

08:21.760 --> 08:23.680
I've promised my father

08:23.760 --> 08:25.120
that I will never interfere
in your teaching.

08:25.200 --> 08:27.800
Certainly, we'll follow your rules.

09:52.600 --> 09:54.200
- My lord.
- I'm worried about the Beauty,

09:54.840 --> 09:56.760
but I can't help her.

09:56.840 --> 09:59.680
I can only stay with her.

10:23.240 --> 10:24.200
Your Majesty.

10:28.400 --> 10:29.320
Greetings…

10:29.400 --> 10:30.920
Greetings, Your Majesty.

10:32.400 --> 10:33.640
Green Jade Hairpin.

10:34.480 --> 10:38.000
Your Highness, these peonies
are His Majesty's favorite.

10:40.800 --> 10:41.880
Peonies?

10:43.440 --> 10:44.440
Aren't these cabbages?

10:45.440 --> 10:46.680
This is a new variety of peony

10:46.760 --> 10:48.760
that the Grand Agronomist's gardeners

10:48.840 --> 10:51.280
spent three years cultivating.

10:55.640 --> 10:56.640
Your Majesty,

10:56.720 --> 10:59.720
I didn't know these flowers
were so precious.

10:59.800 --> 11:02.680
It's because they look
the most beautiful that I--

11:02.760 --> 11:04.080
Fortunately, I came just in time.

11:04.160 --> 11:05.720
You have yet to dig out the roots.

11:06.600 --> 11:07.760
If you like them,

11:07.840 --> 11:10.200
just move them to Fanghua Palace.

11:10.760 --> 11:11.600
No.

11:12.760 --> 11:14.480
I didn't come to steal flowers.

11:15.080 --> 11:17.040
I just wanted to dig up some soil.

11:19.200 --> 11:20.200
Did up some soil?

11:24.280 --> 11:25.320
Your Majesty.

11:30.200 --> 11:31.040
Please forgive her.

11:31.640 --> 11:34.480
Someone close to Concubine Yan and me
passed away recently.

11:35.560 --> 11:36.520
There is a custom in Xiyan.

11:37.120 --> 11:38.600
If a person from Xiyan dies
in a foreign land,

11:39.200 --> 11:40.440
they must be commemorated
with Yisang flowers.

11:40.520 --> 11:42.360
There are no Yisang flowers in Great Yan.

11:43.640 --> 11:46.240
Her Highness
found some Yisang flower seeds.

11:46.800 --> 11:47.840
The deceased had been taking care
of Her Highness a lot

11:47.920 --> 11:49.120
since she was a kid.

11:49.880 --> 11:50.840
Without doing so,

11:50.920 --> 11:52.480
Her Highness cannot alleviate her grief.

11:53.560 --> 11:54.440
I see.

11:56.480 --> 11:57.320
Concubine Yan, get up.

11:59.120 --> 12:00.520
Thank you, Your Majesty.

12:03.440 --> 12:05.760
Have the Director of Agriculture arrange
for several gardeners

12:05.840 --> 12:07.040
to go to the Fanghua Palace
to help Concubine Yan

12:07.120 --> 12:07.960
cultivate Yisang flowers.

12:08.560 --> 12:09.400
Yes, Your Majesty.

12:26.840 --> 12:30.160
FUFANG PAVILION

12:31.120 --> 12:33.280
Be careful sending them
to the Court of State Ceremonial.

12:33.880 --> 12:36.160
If you damage them,
it will upset Prince Jing.

12:36.760 --> 12:38.120
Understood, Sir.

12:38.200 --> 12:41.000
Did Prince Jing order these pastries?

12:41.080 --> 12:43.400
Sir, after the Shangsi Festival,

12:43.480 --> 12:45.000
Prince Jing had his men

12:45.080 --> 12:47.680
order all these kinds of pastries.

12:49.080 --> 12:51.400
It's said it's for celebrating
a Beauty's birthday.

12:54.080 --> 12:56.240
If you need any pastries, Sir,

12:56.320 --> 12:58.600
please come in with me.
You can pick anything you want.

13:00.000 --> 13:02.080
I don't want to eat pastries today.

13:02.160 --> 13:04.960
But there is something I want to ask you.

13:05.600 --> 13:06.640
Well…

13:08.520 --> 13:09.800
After you, Sir.

13:10.400 --> 13:11.560
After you.

13:32.880 --> 13:34.480
Zigu, are you angry again?

13:37.560 --> 13:38.960
When did Shumo fall ill?

13:45.200 --> 13:48.040
I know you kept it from me because
you were afraid I would worry.

13:48.120 --> 13:49.800
But I'm no longer a child.

13:50.640 --> 13:52.200
Shumo had been ill for a long time.

13:52.760 --> 13:54.800
He didn't want us to worry,
so he had kept it from us.

13:56.000 --> 13:58.280
I'm hanging Yisang flowers for him.

13:58.880 --> 14:00.080
He is now back in Xiyan.

14:05.480 --> 14:09.200
Brother, why are we always parting?

14:10.280 --> 14:11.920
After you go back to Xiyan this time,

14:12.960 --> 14:15.360
we will never meet again, won't we?

14:16.120 --> 14:17.240
We will meet again.

14:17.840 --> 14:20.920
I promise you I will come back
to Zhaojing to see you.

14:22.360 --> 14:23.240
Really?

14:24.080 --> 14:25.080
Of course.

14:27.240 --> 14:29.520
But you lied to me before.

14:30.800 --> 14:32.400
When our mother passed away,

14:32.480 --> 14:35.600
you clearly promised me
no matter what happened,

14:35.680 --> 14:37.600
you would stay by my side.

14:48.920 --> 14:49.760
Sir,

14:50.480 --> 14:52.360
it's time to set off.

14:53.600 --> 14:54.440
Wait a while longer.

14:56.680 --> 14:57.560
Chagu said

14:57.640 --> 14:59.760
the princess was really angry this time.

14:59.840 --> 15:01.520
She said it was a good thing
you were leaving.

15:01.600 --> 15:04.400
No one would discipline her anymore.
She could do anything she wanted.

15:06.880 --> 15:09.240
Sir, how can you still laugh?

15:10.840 --> 15:13.280
Ziyu is always watching her
and telling on her.

15:13.360 --> 15:15.080
She wouldn't dare to do
anything out of line.

15:15.960 --> 15:17.200
Liar.

15:17.280 --> 15:18.120
Big liar.

15:21.440 --> 15:22.440
Your Highness,

15:22.520 --> 15:23.640
Mr. Yue Qin is about to go to Great Yan.

15:23.720 --> 15:24.920
If you don't go now, it'll be too late.

15:25.000 --> 15:26.120
I won't go.

15:27.760 --> 15:30.080
I swore to the gods last night.

15:30.160 --> 15:32.240
If he really leaves,
I will never forgive him.

15:36.800 --> 15:37.920
She has always been

15:38.520 --> 15:41.600
this childish,
acting on her whims and moods.

15:41.680 --> 15:44.480
When our mother passed away,
she was only eight.

15:44.560 --> 15:46.240
I've been strict in teaching her

15:46.880 --> 15:48.560
to be more mature and sensible,

15:49.680 --> 15:52.520
hoping she'll grow up faster
and avoid causing trouble.

15:54.040 --> 15:55.640
But now I'm leaving.

15:57.400 --> 15:58.640
I can't protect her anymore.

16:00.040 --> 16:02.480
Now, I don't want her to grow up.

16:04.080 --> 16:07.000
Am I very greedy?

16:15.360 --> 16:16.560
Let's go.

16:22.680 --> 16:23.720
Mr. Yue Qin is really leaving.

16:32.200 --> 16:34.840
Brother, don't go!

16:36.920 --> 16:38.120
Brother,

16:38.200 --> 16:39.760
don't go!

16:56.640 --> 16:57.720
Chagu,

16:59.760 --> 17:01.200
I have no mother now.

17:02.400 --> 17:04.040
I've also lost my brother.

17:10.440 --> 17:13.000
I thought that if I went
to plead with Father,

17:13.079 --> 17:14.359
kneeling for three days and nights,

17:14.440 --> 17:16.000
or seven days if that didn't work,

17:16.079 --> 17:17.760
and even if it meant getting beaten,

17:18.680 --> 17:21.560
you would always find a way
as you did before.

17:21.640 --> 17:23.920
I thought if I was angry,

17:24.520 --> 17:25.640
you would not leave.

17:27.960 --> 17:29.560
It was my fault.

17:33.200 --> 17:34.320
I know that back then,

17:35.720 --> 17:38.400
if it weren't for you going
as a Hostage Prince,

17:38.480 --> 17:40.400
it would have been me going
for a peace-making marriage.

17:42.880 --> 17:44.560
Actually, I lied to the gods.

17:46.520 --> 17:48.200
I forgave you long ago.

17:50.440 --> 17:51.320
Zigu,

17:51.960 --> 17:54.360
I promise you I won't lie to you again.

17:58.400 --> 17:59.800
I've grown up.

18:00.400 --> 18:02.520
It's my turn to protect you now.

18:04.640 --> 18:05.480
Okay.

18:08.360 --> 18:11.920
YANMING PALACE

18:44.040 --> 18:46.320
You have played go with me
these past few years,

18:46.920 --> 18:48.440
but only today have you shown

18:48.520 --> 18:50.760
your true strength.

18:52.760 --> 18:54.800
I concede defeat
from the bottom of my heart.

18:54.880 --> 18:57.200
Winning this half-move
against Your Majesty

18:57.280 --> 18:58.800
has already taken all my effort.

18:58.880 --> 18:59.880
I'm flattered, Your Majesty.

18:59.960 --> 19:01.680
There's no need for modesty.

19:02.600 --> 19:04.040
When it comes to the art of go in Xiyan,

19:05.000 --> 19:06.640
as long as you put your heart into it,

19:07.240 --> 19:09.520
there's no game you can't win.

19:10.400 --> 19:11.600
I want to win.

19:12.320 --> 19:13.400
But to win,

19:13.920 --> 19:15.560
I have to rely on the go style

19:15.640 --> 19:17.200
I've learned from Your Majesty
over the years.

19:17.880 --> 19:20.760
The majesty of Great Yan's ruler
is the key to victory.

19:25.720 --> 19:27.000
Have you really come around?

19:27.600 --> 19:29.080
If I still don't understand,

19:29.840 --> 19:32.160
wouldn't I be failing to live up
to Your Majesty's kindness?

19:34.840 --> 19:36.400
Why have you only developed

19:37.160 --> 19:38.600
great ambitions today?

19:38.680 --> 19:40.360
Your Majesty, you can see

19:41.320 --> 19:43.240
I'm not an ambitious man.

19:44.440 --> 19:47.200
Your Majesty, you're wise
and are willing to provide me with support

19:47.960 --> 19:50.280
for the long-standing peace
between Great Yan and Xiyan.

19:51.200 --> 19:52.520
The reason I want to win

19:53.160 --> 19:55.200
is to protect those around me.

19:56.240 --> 19:58.680
Your Majesty, you have said Concubine Yan

19:58.760 --> 20:00.600
is a symbol of peace
between the two nations.

20:01.200 --> 20:03.040
As long as Great Yan and Xiyan
maintain good relations,

20:03.640 --> 20:06.240
Her Highness can live out
her days peacefully in Great Yan.

20:07.240 --> 20:08.600
The Emperor does not speak lightly.

20:09.640 --> 20:11.720
I'm quite moved

20:11.800 --> 20:13.600
by the affection
between you and Concubine Yan.

20:13.680 --> 20:15.960
Liu Zhong, the gift list.

20:19.480 --> 20:20.760
These are gifts prepared for you

20:21.320 --> 20:23.520
by Concubine Yan for your return home.

20:24.400 --> 20:26.760
She constantly talks to me

20:26.840 --> 20:28.680
about what you like and dislike,

20:29.320 --> 20:31.200
always worried that your journey
might be difficult

20:31.280 --> 20:32.640
and that you might suffer along the way.

20:33.760 --> 20:35.280
Her Highness may be impulsive,

20:35.360 --> 20:37.920
but she is ultimately
someone without guile.

20:38.720 --> 20:41.280
If there are any improper actions
in the future,

20:43.920 --> 20:45.280
I hope Your Majesty will show mercy.

20:46.760 --> 20:48.920
Someone as genuine as Concubine Yan

20:50.120 --> 20:51.840
is rare in the imperial harem.

20:54.560 --> 20:55.680
I wish for her

20:56.440 --> 20:58.040
to remain forever innocent.

21:09.680 --> 21:11.560
- Mei, happy birth--
- Mei, happy birth--

21:13.680 --> 21:15.640
These are all given by Prince Jing?

21:20.720 --> 21:23.560
This piece of clothing is so heavy,
and it's not really gorgeous.

21:25.960 --> 21:27.800
I thought Prince Jing
was deeply in love with you.

21:27.880 --> 21:29.000
How could he be so petty?

21:29.080 --> 21:31.120
There is not even
a golden swaying ornament.

21:31.720 --> 21:33.080
Mei doesn't wear those things.

21:33.160 --> 21:35.800
- I think Prince Jing is thoughtful.
- Gold Silk Armor.

21:38.000 --> 21:39.880
Wound powder.

21:39.960 --> 21:42.040
They're all bottles of medicine.

21:42.120 --> 21:44.480
Isn't Prince Jing cursing Mei to get hurt?

21:45.920 --> 21:48.640
Prince Jing can even see
such a small wound.

21:48.720 --> 21:50.720
Now, I kind of believe in him.

21:50.800 --> 21:53.720
I don't think his feelings
toward Mei are feigned.

21:53.800 --> 21:54.800
Don't misjudge him.

21:54.880 --> 21:56.400
It's fine if we misjudge him.

21:56.480 --> 21:58.080
As long as Mei doesn't misjudge him.

21:58.160 --> 21:59.600
What do you think, Mei?

22:00.480 --> 22:01.320
Me?

22:04.000 --> 22:06.560
Prince Jing speaks with a mix
of truth and falsehood.

22:07.920 --> 22:09.200
Actually,

22:09.280 --> 22:11.840
I can't often see through him either.

22:12.480 --> 22:13.520
Scar-removing cream.

22:13.600 --> 22:14.920
This is the scar-removing cream
from the Xinfang Garden.

22:15.000 --> 22:17.400
It's just for noble ladies
and is never sold publicly.

22:18.520 --> 22:21.800
Mei, you have so many bottles.
Can you give me one?

22:22.480 --> 22:24.280
What happened to you? Did you get hurt?

22:25.440 --> 22:27.520
I accidentally hurt my arm a few days ago.

22:27.600 --> 22:29.920
The scar is very big and ugly.

22:30.520 --> 22:31.680
It's not on your face.

22:31.760 --> 22:32.920
It's not a big deal.

22:33.000 --> 22:33.960
What do you know?

22:34.040 --> 22:35.640
I'm going to serve the Crown Prince.

22:35.720 --> 22:38.040
I can have no scar on my body.

22:38.120 --> 22:39.040
Jia,

22:39.880 --> 22:41.080
must you go to the Eastern Palace?

22:43.440 --> 22:44.880
It's just her wish.

22:44.960 --> 22:46.920
We don't get to choose.

22:47.000 --> 22:50.240
Well, with my pretty face,

22:50.320 --> 22:51.680
I'm sure the Crown Prince
will be interested in me.

22:52.480 --> 22:53.720
Mei,

22:55.000 --> 22:56.760
did you do that with Prince Jing?

22:56.840 --> 22:58.000
Do what?

22:58.080 --> 22:59.640
The thing people do
when they get undressed.

22:59.720 --> 23:01.120
Get undressed?

23:01.200 --> 23:03.000
- Why do we do that?
- Sit.

23:04.640 --> 23:05.760
You haven't done it, right?

23:06.920 --> 23:08.400
Then it's useful for you.

23:08.480 --> 23:10.200
THE SECRET ARTS OF THE BEDROOM

23:16.480 --> 23:17.960
Well…

23:21.000 --> 23:23.720
How can you give her this on her birthday?

23:23.800 --> 23:25.320
Didn't you say gifts should be practical?

23:25.400 --> 23:26.720
This is the most practical.

23:27.400 --> 23:28.800
Jia,

23:32.960 --> 23:34.640
today is my birthday.

23:35.280 --> 23:36.840
I haven't celebrated my birthday
for many years.

23:37.600 --> 23:39.080
Thank you for being with me.

23:39.160 --> 23:40.920
When you enjoy your life
in Prince Jing's Mansion,

23:41.000 --> 23:41.840
don't forget about me.

23:42.440 --> 23:44.480
Please don't forget about me either.

23:45.240 --> 23:46.360
How can I forget about you?

23:47.040 --> 23:49.200
- Let's go pick the gifts.
- Okay.

23:49.280 --> 23:51.800
Pick the gifts. Pick the gifts.

24:58.440 --> 24:59.960
Sir.

25:00.040 --> 25:01.600
Miss Mei Lin, happy birthday!

25:03.160 --> 25:04.400
Thank you, Sir.

25:05.320 --> 25:06.480
I've heard

25:07.120 --> 25:09.480
when Qingzhou people
celebrate their birthdays,

25:09.560 --> 25:10.760
they eat Dengguo Cakes.

25:10.840 --> 25:12.920
I've added mountain licorice

25:13.000 --> 25:15.080
in the Dengguo Cakes. Try them.

25:15.160 --> 25:16.280
It won't be sour.

25:20.440 --> 25:22.640
Actually, today is not my birthday.

25:27.080 --> 25:27.920
It turns out

25:28.720 --> 25:31.040
the birth dates in the list of Beauties
for the marriage alliance are incorrect.

25:31.760 --> 25:32.640
Well…

25:32.720 --> 25:34.880
Who said I can't eat Dengguo Cakes
if it's not my birthday?

25:36.720 --> 25:39.880
I can eat the Dengguo Cakes
you made for me until tomorrow.

25:42.040 --> 25:43.320
Mei Lin, sit.

25:53.240 --> 25:56.400
Actually, even if today
is not your birthday,

25:57.000 --> 25:58.280
I have something to tell you.

26:02.440 --> 26:04.960
This jade ring
is something I keep close to me.

26:05.720 --> 26:07.320
If anything happens to you in Zhaojing,

26:07.920 --> 26:09.280
you can go to Mr. Huang

26:09.920 --> 26:11.680
in Tianxiang Tower with this.

26:11.760 --> 26:14.680
This man's influence in Zhaojing
is complex and extensive.

26:14.760 --> 26:16.040
He can surely help you.

26:20.080 --> 26:22.240
You've already helped me a lot.

26:24.160 --> 26:26.440
Mr. Yue Qin, you are
a rule-abiding person.

26:26.520 --> 26:28.680
How can you disturb my woman

26:29.520 --> 26:30.640
in the middle of the night?

26:41.360 --> 26:44.640
There's no need to act in front of me.

26:45.320 --> 26:47.240
You are merely
in a cooperative relationship.

26:47.320 --> 26:48.600
How do you know there won't be a day

26:48.680 --> 26:51.440
when our fake relationship becomes real?

26:55.880 --> 26:57.440
Mei Lin is a sincere person

26:58.200 --> 26:59.720
and would not seek genuine feelings
in a pretense.

27:02.400 --> 27:04.160
If you're not meant to walk the same path,

27:04.840 --> 27:07.120
don't pursue the destiny
of traveling together.

27:11.480 --> 27:12.320
Miss Mei Lin,

27:12.400 --> 27:13.600
There are too many so-called companions

27:13.680 --> 27:15.720
who will stab you in the back
in this world.

27:18.520 --> 27:19.840
Only Mei and I

27:20.840 --> 27:22.480
share joys and sorrows

27:22.560 --> 27:24.280
and face life and death together.

27:31.360 --> 27:33.440
Sir, rest assured.

27:34.600 --> 27:37.440
I won't entrust my life to anyone easily.

27:42.160 --> 27:43.400
Let me remind you,

27:44.040 --> 27:47.400
what you need to do is in Xiyan.

27:47.480 --> 27:50.880
Everything else is a waste of effort.

27:55.160 --> 27:58.000
Today is Mei's birthday.

27:58.080 --> 27:59.920
If you are still interested,

28:00.000 --> 28:03.440
you may join us on our journey.

28:59.680 --> 29:01.000
Is this your first time on a boat?

29:03.240 --> 29:04.080
No.

29:04.680 --> 29:06.920
When I was a kid, my father
took me boating on the lake.

29:10.560 --> 29:11.960
When I was younger,

29:12.040 --> 29:13.760
I went to the northern borders
of Great Yan for battle.

29:15.080 --> 29:16.800
When sailing down the Lancang River,

29:17.400 --> 29:19.840
I saw a blue starry river.

29:21.520 --> 29:22.880
That's the most beautiful scenery

29:23.840 --> 29:24.960
I've ever seen.

29:25.840 --> 29:28.600
How could there be a blue starry river
on the Lancang River?

29:28.680 --> 29:30.840
It was caused by the gathering
of mayflies in the river.

29:32.640 --> 29:36.240
There is a legend
about that blue starry river.

29:37.480 --> 29:39.720
Once upon a time,

29:39.800 --> 29:42.800
there was a bird fairy clad
in a blue-feathered divine robe

29:42.880 --> 29:45.240
who was enchanted by the scenery
of Yuqing Mountain

29:45.320 --> 29:46.520
and transformed into a maiden.

29:46.600 --> 29:47.640
She was playing there

29:49.040 --> 29:50.800
when a young boy happened to pass by.

29:51.320 --> 29:53.400
The two fell in love at first sight.

29:54.120 --> 29:56.240
In order to stay with the young boy
in the mortal world,

29:56.840 --> 29:58.720
she cast the blue-feathered divine robe
into the river

29:59.360 --> 30:01.400
and it became the blue starry river.

30:16.040 --> 30:19.120
What's going on?

30:29.800 --> 30:31.120
However, Lancang River is too far away.

30:32.000 --> 30:34.880
So, I moved the blue starry river here
for you.

30:36.600 --> 30:39.440
I want you to see
the most beautiful scenery

30:40.200 --> 30:41.560
I've ever seen.

31:00.560 --> 31:02.200
There is a legend by the Lancang River

31:02.280 --> 31:04.800
that if mortals see the starry river,
they can be together forever.

31:04.880 --> 31:07.200
Prince Jing must be deeply in love
with Mei Lin.

31:07.280 --> 31:09.920
I don't think there is anything special
about Mei Lin.

31:10.000 --> 31:12.360
She is just pretty.

31:12.440 --> 31:15.320
I think General Yin is most suitable
for Prince Jing.

31:15.400 --> 31:17.160
Those are just old stories from the past.

31:18.080 --> 31:20.920
They actually compare that petite
Beauty to you.

31:40.400 --> 31:43.080
Today is your birthday after all.

31:44.000 --> 31:45.280
Only by doing this

31:45.360 --> 31:47.640
will the Crown Prince
not become suspicious.

31:57.200 --> 31:59.160
Other people's comments
have nothing to do with me.

32:00.400 --> 32:01.800
I'm tired now.

32:01.880 --> 32:04.360
Investigate the Xiyan spies
carefully tomorrow.

32:14.440 --> 32:17.400
Your Highness,
Prince Jing had some his men

32:17.480 --> 32:19.480
take back these mayflies
from Lancang River.

32:19.560 --> 32:21.680
The news of Prince Jing's favor
toward Mei Lin has spread

32:21.760 --> 32:23.880
throughout the Court of State Ceremonial
in these past few days.

32:24.760 --> 32:26.480
In order to deceive me,

32:26.560 --> 32:27.920
he has to deceive the people
in the Court of State Ceremonial.

32:29.560 --> 32:30.920
What did the shopkeeper
in Fufang Pavilion say?

32:31.560 --> 32:32.920
He said on the day
of the Shangsi Festival,

32:33.000 --> 32:34.160
Prince Jing met with a lot of people.

32:34.760 --> 32:36.920
I will have to question them one by one.

32:45.040 --> 32:46.640
It is now past midnight.

32:46.720 --> 32:49.840
Today is your real birthday.

32:54.960 --> 32:55.800
My Lord,

32:56.640 --> 32:59.040
how did you know that?

32:59.840 --> 33:01.840
You are not a real peace-making Beauty.

33:01.920 --> 33:03.560
The birth date on the name list
is certainly fake.

33:04.400 --> 33:06.000
You are cooperating with me.

33:06.080 --> 33:08.880
It's very easy for me to know about you.

33:08.960 --> 33:11.400
Knowing your birthday is nothing strange.

33:22.120 --> 33:24.160
This Dengguo Cake must be very delicious.

33:28.920 --> 33:30.200
Whether it's delicious or not,

33:30.280 --> 33:31.920
you'll have to wait
until your tongue is cured

33:32.000 --> 33:33.360
to judge.

33:35.520 --> 33:36.480
You said it.

33:37.280 --> 33:40.400
The flavors of life don't necessarily
have to be tasted with the tongue.

33:41.080 --> 33:42.680
I can also enjoy them with my eyes.

33:44.440 --> 33:45.400
Look.

33:46.200 --> 33:47.600
This Dengguo Cake is so beautiful.

33:47.680 --> 33:49.120
It must be very delicious.

33:54.120 --> 33:56.880
The imperial physician said
it wasn't difficult to cure your tongue.

33:57.400 --> 33:59.280
As long as you take medicine on time,
you'll be cured.

34:02.080 --> 34:04.720
My mansion recently hired a chef
from Qingzhou.

34:04.800 --> 34:06.920
It's said that he has a secret method
to make Dengguo Cakes.

34:07.000 --> 34:08.760
Whether the chef is a good one or not,

34:08.840 --> 34:11.639
we'll have to wait until
your sense of taste recovers to judge.

34:11.719 --> 34:13.280
The Dengguo Cakes he makes

34:13.360 --> 34:15.080
must be less tasty than the ones
made by my mother.

34:16.639 --> 34:18.520
When the Xiyan people were in Qingzhou,

34:18.600 --> 34:21.000
the neighbors in Qinglin Lane
often paid my mother

34:21.080 --> 34:23.239
for the fruit cakes she made.

34:24.880 --> 34:26.960
If my mother were still alive,

34:27.040 --> 34:29.159
our family's fruit cake shop
would surely be

34:29.239 --> 34:31.400
the best business in all of Qingzhou.

34:36.840 --> 34:37.679
Come.

34:42.159 --> 34:44.600
You told me you looked very much
like your mother.

34:44.679 --> 34:45.840
If you miss her,

34:46.400 --> 34:47.560
just look at "her".

35:03.280 --> 35:04.320
The eyes

35:05.200 --> 35:06.040
are bigger.

35:07.760 --> 35:08.880
The nose

35:10.120 --> 35:11.240
is similar to hers.

35:14.040 --> 35:16.480
Here, there are wrinkles.

35:19.080 --> 35:20.280
The chin…

35:27.760 --> 35:28.960
Mother,

35:32.800 --> 35:34.160
I miss you.

35:44.440 --> 35:45.280
My lord,

35:47.360 --> 35:48.480
thank you.

35:49.520 --> 35:51.840
Today is your birthday.

35:52.520 --> 35:55.640
I will give you another birthday gift.

36:52.120 --> 36:55.360
What's the name
of your family's fruit cake shop?

36:56.840 --> 36:58.240
Spring Flower Cake Shop.

37:09.640 --> 37:11.160
SPRING FLOWER CAKE SHOP

37:20.320 --> 37:21.600
In our backyard,

37:21.680 --> 37:23.760
there was a Dengguo wood.

37:25.640 --> 37:27.440
Every year, when it snowed,

37:28.040 --> 37:29.600
the fruits on the trees

37:30.160 --> 37:32.160
were as beautiful
as the wintersweet you painted.

37:32.840 --> 37:34.400
Besides opening a fruit cake shop,

37:34.480 --> 37:35.800
do you have other wishes?

37:37.000 --> 37:38.040
Successful revenge.

37:38.840 --> 37:39.920
What else?

37:42.080 --> 37:43.440
I want to live on well,

37:46.560 --> 37:48.960
carrying the share of my father and mother

37:50.440 --> 37:52.240
with me.

38:08.040 --> 38:09.960
I also want to go to Lancang River

38:10.760 --> 38:12.640
to see the real starry river.

38:20.320 --> 38:22.080
Once the Crown Prince
faces his punishment,

38:22.720 --> 38:26.040
I will help you open
a Spring Flower Cake Shop,

38:29.640 --> 38:30.760
with a fifty-fifty profit split.

38:35.000 --> 38:36.080
It's a deal.

38:37.640 --> 38:38.680
It's a deal.

38:48.600 --> 38:50.840
NICHANG COURTYARD

38:56.960 --> 38:58.480
- Mei.
- Mei.

39:00.920 --> 39:01.760
Mei.

39:01.840 --> 39:03.760
The pastries today
are particularly delicate.

39:03.840 --> 39:04.680
Try them.

39:05.200 --> 39:06.760
I'll try them later.

39:07.480 --> 39:10.320
Today, Attendant Liu went to the kitchen
and instructed that the pastries

39:10.400 --> 39:13.360
at the Court of State Ceremonial
must be particularly delicate.

39:13.440 --> 39:15.320
She said it was Prince Jing's orders.

39:20.960 --> 39:22.240
You said it.

39:22.320 --> 39:25.760
The flavors don't necessarily
have to be tasted with the tongue.

39:26.320 --> 39:27.760
I can also enjoy them with my eyes.

39:28.360 --> 39:29.200
Look.

39:29.960 --> 39:32.600
This Dengguo Cake is so beautiful.
It must be very delicious.

39:45.760 --> 39:47.040
It's tasty.

39:48.640 --> 39:50.560
Mei, what are you making?
Let me take a look.

39:54.960 --> 39:56.960
I didn't expect you to have this skill.

40:00.720 --> 40:02.280
These fragrance pills don't smell good.

40:02.360 --> 40:03.200
There's even a strange odor.

40:04.040 --> 40:04.880
Let me smell them.

40:07.560 --> 40:09.240
I think they smell good.

40:09.320 --> 40:10.720
You say that
because you can't smell, right?

40:10.800 --> 40:12.200
Who said it?

40:12.280 --> 40:14.560
They contain sandalwood, agarwood,

40:14.640 --> 40:17.040
spikenard,

40:17.120 --> 40:18.200
and…

40:19.080 --> 40:19.960
And rose water.

40:20.040 --> 40:21.200
Right.

40:21.880 --> 40:23.520
All of these have a calming effect
and can help with sleep.

40:24.120 --> 40:25.800
Mei, can't you fall asleep?

40:26.440 --> 40:27.920
She sleeps very well.

40:28.000 --> 40:28.960
On the way here,

40:29.040 --> 40:30.960
she was always the first one
to fall asleep.

40:35.720 --> 40:37.120
- Is it for Prince Jing?
- Is it for Prince Jing?

40:55.080 --> 40:56.440
The taste is not important.

40:56.520 --> 40:57.680
The appearance matters.

40:57.760 --> 41:00.120
That was Prince Jing's order.

41:00.800 --> 41:03.280
It seems Mei Lin can't taste anything.

41:04.680 --> 41:06.680
Got it. You may leave.

41:16.000 --> 41:16.840
That's indeed the case.

41:16.920 --> 41:18.320
Mei Lin has no sense of taste.

41:18.920 --> 41:20.400
On the day of the Shangsi Festival,

41:20.480 --> 41:21.880
Prince Jing went out
to get the Beauty treated.

41:22.920 --> 41:25.000
Sun Taiqing from the Imperial Medical
Institute was beaten by Prince Jing

41:25.080 --> 41:26.480
because he failed to cure her.

41:27.520 --> 41:28.360
Your Highness,

41:29.200 --> 41:31.040
if Mei Lin were just a pawn,

41:31.760 --> 41:33.680
Prince Jing wouldn't have to go
to such lengths.

41:37.120 --> 41:38.720
Jinghe is truly in love.

41:38.800 --> 41:40.520
He has fallen in love with his pawn.

41:41.760 --> 41:44.120
It's not a bad thing for me and Luomei.

41:45.440 --> 41:46.280
Now,

41:47.320 --> 41:49.000
I'm reluctant to let you die.

41:49.680 --> 41:51.960
By the way, how is the progress
of General Yin's investigation?

41:53.280 --> 41:54.240
Your Highness,

41:54.320 --> 41:57.520
General Yin
has found the ten burnt Beauties.

41:59.320 --> 42:01.040
Go and instruct them personally.

42:01.120 --> 42:02.600
Make sure those Beauties insist

42:02.680 --> 42:04.920
they were threatened by Prince Jing.

42:05.520 --> 42:06.360
Yes, Your Highness.

42:10.480 --> 42:11.840
Jinghe,

42:11.920 --> 42:13.720
for the sake of Luomei,

42:13.800 --> 42:16.240
in this round, I'll still go easy on you.

42:18.360 --> 42:19.880
As long as you can go back to Jingbei,

42:21.520 --> 42:23.000
we can still be brothers.

42:28.240 --> 42:30.360
- Hurry and move.
- Hurry up.

42:31.520 --> 42:32.720
Li Qing is crucial.

42:32.800 --> 42:35.400
Go investigate him thoroughly in person.

42:35.480 --> 42:37.800
Hurry up. Hurry up.

42:37.880 --> 42:38.760
Move.

42:39.520 --> 42:40.360
Move.

42:40.960 --> 42:43.360
Quiet. Get up.

42:44.920 --> 42:45.760
Don't let him run away!

42:50.000 --> 42:51.400
Hurry and move. Hurry up.

42:51.480 --> 42:53.640
- Hurry up. Hurry up.
- Move.

42:53.720 --> 42:55.160
Hurry up. Hurry up.

42:55.240 --> 42:56.400
Get up.

42:56.480 --> 42:58.520
- Get up. Get up.
- Did you see that?

42:58.600 --> 42:59.440
Carry him away.

42:59.520 --> 43:01.520
I'll whip you if you don't work hard.
Hurry up.

43:02.960 --> 43:03.960
Hurry up.

43:04.920 --> 43:05.800
Hurry up!

43:06.880 --> 43:08.640
- Hurry up.
- Follow closely.

43:08.720 --> 43:09.760
Hurry up.

43:09.840 --> 43:10.920
Hurry up.

43:11.000 --> 43:12.000
Time to eat.

43:23.280 --> 43:24.800
Give me one.

43:30.200 --> 43:32.040
- Time to eat.
- Quicky, eat!

43:32.560 --> 43:34.440
LI QING

43:42.080 --> 43:45.000
The only person who can
definitively implicate the Crown Prince

43:45.080 --> 43:46.760
is the strategist Li Qing.

43:47.600 --> 43:49.000
Li Qing is still alive?

43:51.640 --> 43:52.880
Li Qing.
